30	// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
31	// Every function here is scoped by the caller's internal `users.id` (see
32	// lib/db/current-user.ts). This is the real replacement for lib/store.ts —
33	// same function names and return shapes, backed by Postgres instead of a
34	// mutable object on globalThis. The Drizzle schema is the shared `@repo/db`
35	// package (camelCase columns, `Date` timestamps).
